    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>You lower your weapon just enough for them to see the choice. &quot;Lay down your arms. You have my word you will leave this field alive.&quot;</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Main Action</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>Guile</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>A group of Frightened NPC enemies within 6 squares who hear and understand you.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Skill / Social / Control</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Offer safety in exchange for surrender. Make a Guile roll toward the group&#39;s surrender task.</p><dl class=\"hol-reference-outcomes\"><dt>Weak</dt><dd>3 progress.</dd><dt>Standard</dt><dd>5 progress.</dd><dt>Strong</dt><dd>7 progress.</dd></dl></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/f3fb98ca03b046335fcc730c1b05689bebf091b4/design/cards/terms-before-swords.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/terms-before-swords.md</a> at <code>f3fb98ca03b046335fcc730c1b05689bebf091b4</code>.</p></section>",
